{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Last Spaceship&quot; is an adventure puzzle game in a post apocalyptic world. The last human spaceship crashes into the desert, and the maintenance robot &quot;Traveler&quot; struggles to cross half of the earth to reach the ruins of the spaceship. With the help of the intelligent core small robot &quot;jijigugu&quot; of the spaceship, the traveler explores all the cabins of the spaceship, collects interesting &quot;human heritage&quot; , solves brain teasing puzzles, gradually repairs the spaceship, and experience a thrilling story about war, extinction, rescue, and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the story, will this spaceship sail towards the starry sea?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920780?t=1755573781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/dbe0c4fa95f5fdc03a49f8b0fdc5814114073799/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755573781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/22251e891093a3250d77cb14fd7095858f29857b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755573781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/22251e891093a3250d77cb14fd7095858f29857b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755573781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Last Spaceship&quot; is an adventure puzzle game in a post apocalyptic world. The last human spaceship crashes into the desert, and the maintenance robot &quot;Traveler&quot; struggles to cross half of the earth to reach the ruins of the spaceship. With the help of the intelligent core small robot &quot;jijigugu&quot; of the spaceship, the traveler explores all the ca